cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below and cite the source dataset paper."
title: "ZhiDun: National Crime Spatiotemporal Analysis and Early Warning Demonstration System"
abstract: "A Vue 3 + Node.js historical-data demonstration system for national crime spatiotemporal analysis, GIS visualization, lightweight forecasting, and early-warning workflows in China. Forecasting components are explicitly Lite implementations intended for teaching and demonstration rather than operational policing."
